flowchart TD
    A[Training Dataset] --> B[Feature Validation]
    B --> C[Model Training Pipeline]

    C --> C1[Baseline Regressor]
    C --> C2[Two Stage Model]
    C --> C3[Ensemble Model]

    C1 --> D[Model Evaluation]
    C2 --> D
    C3 --> D

    D --> E{Performance Gate}
    E -->|Pass| F[Model Registry]
    E -->|Fail| B

    F --> G[Batch Inference]
    F --> H[Online Inference]

    G --> I[Predicted Price]
    H --> I

    I --> J[Residual/Error Analysis]
    J --> K[Derived ML Signals]
    K --> L[Feedback to Data Layer]
    L --> A
